y that threatens to rip a young couple apart at the seams.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/733b26153cf15dee97d6e69f56b1d354/rokuFeed/assets/0e18363fd16157b082c7e87692b60ef0.jpg"},{"s":1796028973,"e":1796035462,"t":"False Witness","d":"Assistant DA's (Phylicia Rashad) co-worker/lover (Philip Michael Thomas) thinks she's wrong.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/a3dc6237cf4754f5b6fe7cc87a7971f0/rokuFeed/assets/88cb38c36f5c5e849559c04cbc26391f.jpg"},{"s":1796035462,"e":1796042473,"t":"Life of a King","d":"An ex-con (Cuba Gooding Jr.) teaches chess to at-risk high-school students.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/93aa71bc21a053889d28894d69cab063/rokuFeed/assets/13a34fa85c3859e4a65c8b5b173038c0.jpg"},{"s":1796042473,"e":1796049268,"t":"The Best Thing!","d":"Restaurant owner Justin Alexander's life takes a dramatic turn when he finds out that he may have a son.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/bec23b493a8a505aa16d051c832ea14b/rokuFeed/assets/29319ed294805fdfa7b392271db3229f.jpg"},{"s":1796049268,"e":1796054780,"t":"I'm Charlie Walker","d":"Entrepreneur Charlie Walker fights institutional racism while cleaning up a massive oil spill.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/a20d495e13845fcc9d1087985e0f9187/rokuFeed/assets/c0e8d26ad24e5be9b0f41ac93bba9475.jpg"},{"s":1796054780,"e":1796059598,"t":"Nola Life","d":"Exposing the dark side of the Big Easy underworld, where any day could be someone's last.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b602a5d20c1a5683b8fbcf65c4b2ee27/rokuFeed/assets/de2b4055203f50b9ba132fa4e2e126ea.jpg"},{"s":1796059598,"e":1796065934,"t":"Fifty Shades Of Black [Broadcast Edit]","d":"Christian Black has it all: power, success, and an intense desire to get freaky. Into his life comes Hannah.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/f03aec80ec3cce2d31c998f8dbadbba6